sequenceDiagram
	participant Customer as Customer (Storefront / Commerce)
	participant Gateway as API Gateway (YARP)
	participant Ordering as Ordering API (.NET 11)
	participant Basket as Basket API (.NET 11 gRPC)
	participant Catalog as Catalog API (.NET 11 gRPC)
	participant Postgres as PostgreSQL (orderingdb)

	Customer ->> Gateway: HTTPS POST /ordering/api/v1/orders (x-request-id)
	Gateway ->> Ordering: Forward authenticated request (Entra ID JWT)
	Ordering ->> Basket: gRPC BasketGrpcService.GetBasket
	Basket -->> Ordering: Persisted basket items & quantities
	Ordering ->> Catalog: gRPC BookGrpcService.GetBooks
	Catalog -->> Ordering: Authoritative book sale/regular prices
	Ordering ->> Postgres: Lock per-Buyer, save New Order + outbox event
	Ordering -->> Customer: 201 Created (orderId)
